OL,3,A'I live with a ghost' - inside the
OL,4,Ahaunted homes attracting bargain
OL,5,Ahunters
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom the moment Ryua first walked into
OL,8,Fher rental apartment in Tokyo she
OL,9,Fbelieved it to be haunted.
OL,11,F"When I visited the place for a viewing
OL,12,Fthere was a man standing there, glaring
OL,13,Fat me," she says.
OL,15,F"Since the estate agent couldn't see
OL,16,Fhim, I realised he must be a ghost."
OL,18,FWhile someone more squeamish would
OL,19,Fprobably have quickly left the flat
OL,20,Fnever to return, Ryua chose to go ahead
OL,21,Fand move in.
